        "retrievedAt": "2026-10-19",
        "covers": "SECONDARY: 2010, 2015 and 2024 barangay populations and 9-digit PSGC codes, which cite PSA. The PSA site was blocked, so these were not checked against PSA directly; their sums match the official city totals (424,150 / 450,741 / 471,323), and the 2020 column matches the city document."
